        {
          "kind": "sysSay",
          "line": "OH. Oh no. ...The gamblers are very quiet."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Ursula Weber is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "Nobody's talking much. The fire feels smaller tonight."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "URSULA — GONE. 5 open questions closed unanswered."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🕯️ Ursula Weber is dead — the wild. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "What Ursula kept close goes into the ground with them — keepsakes are buried, never taken from the body."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "\"Ursula's gone.\" Sari looks at you for a long moment. \"You're not Ursula.\" No heat in it. Just fact. You'll have to earn this face."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Liam blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Reading Weather (Level 1). Red sky at night, shepherd's delight. Red sky at morning, shepherd's warning. It works."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Animal Behavior (Level 1). Most animals flee. Give them an escape route and they take it. Cornered animals fight."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Wire Snares (Level 1). A loop of wire on a game trail. Simple, effective, ancient. Check at dawn."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 LEARNED: Cordage (Level 1). Twist plant fibers into string. Dogbane, nettle, yucca — strong fibers are everywhere."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🌟 \"MANTLE TRANSFER DETECTED. ...Oh! New face! Same job! Whole new set of tricks. We hardly noticed. (That is a lie. We noticed. The audience CRIED.)\""
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "📖 The Codex turns a page: Ursula Weber, 120 days. The mantle passes to Liam Davis."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "🪞 You wake up somebody else. Liam Davis, 42 — a farmer. His hands know different work now: Beast-calm, Lucky Rock, Green Whisper, Beard Moss, Green Thumb, Literally, Cornucopia."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "◈ The System updates its file: the new bearer <redacted> \"Gardener of the Living Garden.\" It had a word for this one before the Codex came."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The village's quarrel was with Ursula — and Ursula is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "You knew Ursula — not the office, the person. The fire keeps expecting her, and so do you. That's a heavier kind of stepping up. (+5 trauma)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "At the grave, Sari, Nolwazi, Makafui speak for Liam — \"Ursula trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
        },
        {
          "kind": "say",
          "line": "The fire knew Liam before the Codex did — his name already carried weight here."
        }
